{"sections":[{"slug":"分类意象","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"分类意象"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">分类意象</span>"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"分类意象"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">观念</span></h2>\n<h3>“<span lang=\"zh\">语法</span>” <span lang=\"zh\">侧</span>: <span lang=\"zh\">意象的表现</span></h3>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">分类意象是以逻辑理论对</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/意象","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">意象</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的一种</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/数学对象的表现","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">表现</span>"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<h3>“<span lang=\"zh\">几何</span>” <span lang=\"zh\">侧</span>: <span lang=\"zh\">作为分类空间</span></h3>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">分类意象作为一种几何对象</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">是</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/分类空间","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">分类空间</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的概念在意象理论中的化身</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">一种结构的分类意象可理解为分类空间上的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/层意象","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">层意象</span>"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<h3>“<span lang=\"zh\">代数</span>” <span lang=\"zh\">侧</span>: <span lang=\"zh\">作为泛对象所在的范畴</span></h3>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">一种结构的</span><strong><span lang=\"zh\">分类意象</span></strong><span lang=\"zh\">可理解为</span> $\\mathsf{Set}$ (<span lang=\"zh\">或</span> $\\mathsf{Ani}$) <span lang=\"zh\">自由加入一个</span> “<span lang=\"zh\">泛</span>” (generic) <span lang=\"zh\">对象所得的意象</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">例如带点对象的分类意象可理解为自由加入一个泛带点对象</span>.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">例</span></h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"/生象","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">生象</span>"}},{"Local":{"url":"/群","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">群</span>"}},{"Plain":" $G$ <span lang=\"zh\">的分类意象即是其</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/逆环路空间","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">逆环路空间</span>"}},{"Plain":" $\\mathbf{B}G$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/层意象","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">层意象</span>"}},{"Plain":", <span lang=\"zh\">也即</span> $\\mathsf{Ani}_{/\\mathbf{B}G} \\simeq \\mathsf{Fun}(\\mathbf{B}G,\\mathsf{Ani})$.</p>\n"}]}}}]}